WEBVTT

00:09:59.996 --> 00:10:02.866
or we are uncomfortable
in difficult situations.

00:10:02.899 --> 00:10:04.801
But others thrive like that.

00:10:04.801 --> 00:10:06.503
Perfect, start there.

00:10:07.170 --> 00:10:09.572
The point is, transitions are difficult.

00:10:09.939 --> 00:10:11.674
Begin with your superpower,

00:10:11.708 --> 00:10:14.511
build confidence, move on from there.

00:10:15.979 --> 00:10:19.282
Tip number two, accept your emotions.

00:10:20.450 --> 00:10:22.118
In addition to three phases,

00:10:22.152 --> 00:10:26.122
I identified seven tools
for how we navigate a life transition.

00:10:26.890 --> 00:10:28.057
Beginning with:

00:10:28.091 --> 00:10:30.827
accept that it's an emotional experience.